@startuml RAG Evaluation Sequence

!include <C4/C4_Sequence>

title Quantumforge RAG Evaluation Sequence Diagram

actor Expert
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer
participant "LLM judge model" as LLMJudge
participant "Log" as Log
participant "Sensitive data remover" as SensitiveDataRemover

Expert -> LogAnalyzer: Provides reference answers
LogAnalyzer -> Log: Reads the log, extracts questions and answers
Log -> LogAnalyzer: Returns questions and answers
LogAnalyzer -> SensitiveDataRemover: Removes sensitive data from questions and answers
SensitiveDataRemover -> LogAnalyzer: Returns sanitized questions and answers
LogAnalyzer -> LLMJudge: Sends the question and answer to the LLM judge model
LLMJudge -> LogAnalyzer: Returns the evaluation result - scores
LogAnalyzer -> Expert: Returns the evaluation results to the expert

@enduml